Package: com.yourepo.b4db1r3r3p0.reprovisionrebornagain
Name: ReProvision Reborn… Again
Version: 0.8.4-roothide.3
Description: Re-sign applications directly on your roothide jailbroken device
 This community-maintained build restores Apple account authentication,
 trusted-device two-factor authentication, background signing, and modern
 provisioning-profile handling for iOS 15 and newer.
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), uikittools
Priority: optional
